WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.543
The original mixed integer solver matches the confirmed design to the available stock.

00:00:06.175 --> 00:00:10.389
Watch the recorded pieces move from their source bars into the model.

00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:15.720
This is a replay of a saved allocation, not a new calculation.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:21.189
Eighty-seven source bars supply one hundred and fifty-five installed parts.

00:00:21.606 --> 00:00:26.220
The model retains every source link, cut, and remainder.
